// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P2092438992" "Mike.  We've got company.  I don't know how they got in here.  Lemme ask them. <br><br> Heya, {HeroName}.  You found us.  Nice work.  Did you search long and hard or did someone tell you?  C'mon, you can tell me.  I won't tell anyone.   Promise.<br><br>Anyway, I knew that if people searched long enough they'd find this little lounge of ours.  So go ahead and make yourself at home. We've got a few comfy couches here and the tv's right over there.  <br><br>You egg hunter, you."
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_Melissa_Eat :
"P1287066257" "Melissa"

