// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1281158456" "{HeroName}, come see me for a moment before you head outside."
// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P2753897966" "That reservoir out there, {HeroName}, is tough.  Tougher than you might expect. <br><br> You'll want to take a few friends with you.  We have a small presence out there, but not enough to be of much help, I'm afraid.  Keep an eye out for the Arachnos base to the West.  It's heavily guarded.  Their turrets have taken out quite a few of our patrols.  Speaking of patrols, keep an eye out for those spider bots of theirs.  Nasty things.  Don't think I'm kidding. <br><br> I never thought we'd have to defend ourselves against Arachnos, but Lord Recluse is not only evil, he's entrepreneurial.  We have something he wants.  When you get strong enough, believe me, we'll be needing you in Recluse's Victory.  For now, study their tactics here since their presence is small.  They've been tunneling this place for ages, going through wrecked supergroup bases looking for materials.  You need to stop them.  Maybe those SkyRaiders will thin their numbers a bit, but I doubt it.<br><br> Good luck, hero.  <br><br>Remember what I said.  That reservoir is tough.  Friends are your best weapon."
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_Dam_Info :
"P2687648340" "Freedom Corps Tactical Officer"
